-- Give every gig a three-tier package ladder (Temel / Standart / Premium).
-- The existing STANDARD package is left untouched (orders reference it); BASIC and
-- PREMIUM are derived from it: Basic ~60% price / +1 gün, Premium ~180% price / -1 gün.
-- Foreign keys resolve by gig slug, and each insert is guarded so re-running is a no-op.

